#: b70c76c1cdc04b5abe31e300abec59b7
msgid "You need to be careful"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:178
#: 4c3dccf36b374fbe87621d1cf1d8e59e
msgid "to use a current sensor that will not provide over 3.3V as too high a voltage on this pin can cause the PX4IO to reset."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:181
#: be753ce17d47499a8248cc9b3782c3fd
msgid "For use with a current sensor, a 0.1uF capacitor between this pin and ground will help reduce \"noise\"."
